changelog.0.1.1:
Now requires Magiclib and Lazylib.&nbsp;
Added the Flash HVM, a very maneuverable short-medium range missile.&nbsp; Comes in small, medium, and large versions.
Added the Critical Point Targeting hullmod.&nbsp; It increases weapon damage, and buffs range slightly, but prevents installation of ITU/DTC.
Added the Eagle II, a modified Eagle with a large hardpoint.&nbsp;
Added a secret ship as a bounty.&nbsp; Thanks to NEON for the sprite.
Fixed hardpoint recoil for Light Mjolnir.&nbsp;
Made the Tachyon Accelerator's projectile much larger for better visibility.
Updated the sprites for the Tachyon Accelerator and Plasma Beam, both are now more visually distinct from the Tachyon Lance and Plasma Cannon.
Updated the Triumphant's sprite-added slightly more plating near the bridge.
Nerfed the Polaris' built-in missile reload slightly.
